{"slug": "practice-dsa-hand-of-straights", "title": "Hand of Straights", "source_url": "https://takeuforward.org/practice/dsa/hand-of-straights", "extracted_by": "live-ssr", "length": 6899, "code_blocks": 0, "images": 0, "html": "<div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__wrapper\"><div class=\"scroll-fade-module__DRol_a__shell ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollContainer\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollable\" data-tufy-selectable=\"\"><header class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__header\"><h1 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__title\">228. Hand of Straights<span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__titlePotdBadge\"></span></h1><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__metaRow\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__shortcutButtons\"></div></div></header><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__content\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>You are given an array of integers hand, where hand[i] is the value on the i<sup>th</sup> card that Alice owns.</p><p>Alice wants to split her entire hand into groups such that:</p><ul><li>every group contains exactly groupSize cards, and</li></ul><ul><li>the card values in each group form a sequence of groupSize consecutive integers (e.g. [3, 4, 5], [10, 11, 12, 13]).</li></ul><p>Return true if such a rearrangement is possible; otherwise return false.</p></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 1:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input:</strong> hand = [1,2,3,6,2,3,4,7,8], groupSize = 3</p><p><strong>Output:</strong> true</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> </p><p>One possible partition is [1,2,3] [2,3,4] [6,7,8].</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 2:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input:</strong> hand = [1,2,3,4,5], groupSize = 4</p><p><strong>Output:</strong> false</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> </p><p>There is no way to split the hand into groups of 4 consecutive cards.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationSection mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2 justify-between w-full\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle mb-0!\">Now Your Turn!</h3><span class=\"body-b5-regular text-text-secondary\">Pick the correct output for the given input</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleGrid\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-border my-auto ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleDivider\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleContent\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input: </strong>hand = [9,9,9], groupSize = 1</p></div></div></div><div aria-required=\"false\" class=\"grid w-full gap-2 ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionsGrid\" data-slot=\"radio-group\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"radiogroup\" style=\"outline:none\" tabindex=\"-1\"><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">true</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">false</span></label></div></section><div aria-label=\"Still unsure what the problem is asking ?\" class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__card\"><div class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__copy\"><p class=\"body-b6-semibold text-text-primary\">Still unsure what the problem is asking ?</p> <p class=\"body-b6-regular text-text-tertiary\">Let’s go through a few more examples, step by step, to make it clearer.</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Constraints:</h3><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__constraintsBox\"><ul><li>1 ≤ hand.length ≤ 10<sup>4</sup></li><li>0 ≤ hand[i] ≤ 10<sup>9</sup></li><li>1 ≤ groupSize ≤ hand.length</li></ul></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Fun Facts</h3><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion\"><div class=\"not-last:border-b ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__accordionItem\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-item\" data-state=\"closed\"><h3 class=\"flex\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"></h3><div aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_1mj4lknqlpfijb_\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm data-open:animate-accordion-down data-closed:animate-accordion-up\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-content\" data-state=\"closed\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_R_5mj4lknqlpfijb_\